  ;; sys_tamago_amd64.s): arch_prctl(ARCH_SET_FS, addr), to set the vCPU's FS base for g (KS3,
  ;; §3.3). The kernel sets the process's FS base (a process cannot WRMSR) and returns 0 in RAX,
